blocks.en:
For every document that has multiple fields, we take the name of the field (e.g. summary_of_the_paper ), remove the underscores and convert it to title case. We then insert double asterisks to the left and right to simulate a bold Markdown header and add the raw text of each section directly afterwards. This is accomplished in a very quick and simple one liner f"**{title}**
{value.strip()}

" .
